// PDL standard-library page protocol (language prelude).
//
// Always in scope — no import required. Compilers inject `Page` into every
// design merge. Restating this file in a pack is documentation only; redefining
// `Page` as a host protocol is PDL-E032.
//
// A `page Name(…) layout { }` declaration auto-satisfies this protocol
// (slot type `content: Page = Home()`). Screens and ordinary components do not.
// Authors may also write `component C emits <Page>()` if they need the bound
// without the destination role.

protocol Page: component { }
